# Measurement output. Regenerated by the scripts; never the source of truth.
#
# Recordings can be large and figures are rebuilt from them in seconds, so
# nothing under out/ is tracked. If a specific run matters, copy its .json
# and .csv (both small, both on the pre-commit allowlist) somewhere deliberate
# and commit them with a message saying what was on the bench that day.
out/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
